"iCloud Drive isn't on for this Mac: turn it on in System Settings → Apple Account → iCloud." = "此 Mac 未开启 iCloud 云盘：请在“系统设置”→“Apple 账户”→“iCloud”中打开。";
"Couldn't make the folder in iCloud Drive." = "无法在 iCloud 云盘中创建文件夹。";
"A file from the iPhone was too big and was set aside." = "来自 iPhone 的文件过大，已放到一旁。";
"A file from the iPhone couldn't be read and was set aside." = "来自 iPhone 的文件无法读取，已放到一旁。";
"Something from the iPhone wasn't kept: it looks like a password or key, matches an excluded pattern, or is too big." = "来自 iPhone 的一项未保留：它像密码或密钥、匹配排除的模式，或过大。";
