"Cocaine: the clipboard needs a newer Shortcut. On the Mac: Settings → Remote work → iPhone → Send." = "Cocaine：剪贴板需要更新的快捷指令。在 Mac 上：设置 → 远程工作 → iPhone → 发送。";
